Work has finished.
Rohan, Priya, and I are going to my house.
We want to celebrate my birthday there.
It is raining very heavily outside.
A lot of water has filled on the roads.
Rohan says, "Maya, the buses are very late today."
Priya says, "Yes, we will go by metro."
I agree with them.
We came out of the office.
We opened our umbrellas and walked to the metro station.
I learned to travel in the metro a few months ago.
In the beginning, it was a little difficult.
But now it has become very easy for me.
We reached the station quickly.
Priya says, "Look, our train has arrived."
We went inside and sat on empty seats.
It is still raining outside.
But we are comfortably going towards my house.
